message: If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: software
title: "CameVision Ego Single Sensor: global-shutter AI camera demo firmware"
abstract: "Open demo firmware for CameVision Ego Single Sensor (CV-EGO01-SS), a Camemake board with one global-shutter camera, one IMU, and an on-board RV1126B vision processor. Sensor options are SmartSens SC233HGS, OmniVision OG02C10, ams OSRAM MIRA220, onsemi AR0235, OmniVision OX05B1S, and Kaimou GS2.3."
